(slower-x8-sv03-3dof)
*title Skywalker X8 powered trim and short route baseline
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*units/fmt alt m f.3
*units/fmt vel m/sec f.3
*units/fmt mass kg f.3
*units/fmt long deg f.3
*units/fmt lat deg f.3
*units/fmt gama deg f.3
*units/fmt psi deg f.3
*trajectory 1 x8 start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=178.0 long=0.0 lat=0.0 vel=17.9 gama=0.0 psi=90.0 time=0.0 mass=3.364
  *segment 1 powered-trim
    *integ dtprnt=0.2 dt=0.05
    *fly alpha=7.9
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) sref=0.75
    *prop thrust=0.44*(thrust) mdot=0
    *when time>0.1 stop
*end
